    "Su %lld votanti. Ognuno può sceglierne fino a 3, quindi la somma supera il 100%.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Out of %lld voters. Each can pick up to 3, so the total goes over 100%."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Su Somto i voti sono in decimi: quello che su TV Time era “Bello” diventa 7, “Super” 9, “Wow” 10, “Ok” 6, “Brutto” 4. Potrai sempre modificarli. Importiamo anche recensioni, rewatch e watchlist.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On Somto, ratings are out of 10: what was “Good” on TV Time becomes 7, “Super” 9, “Wow” 10, “OK” 6, “Bad” 4. You can always change them. We also import reviews, rewatches, and watchlist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
